-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/ORS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Conglomerate and sandstone with subsidiary andesite, basalt, mudstone and siltstone and trace breccia, calcareous sandstone and fault-gouge. Stratified bedrock. Occurs offshore. Deposited during the Pridoli Epoch (Silurian Period) - to - Late Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (422.7-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/WROS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Tonian Period (Precambrian) (1000-720 Ma BP)."@en .
